@startuml BandRental_Management_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Band Rental Management (Pengurus)

actor Pengurus
participant "Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant System
database Database

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Buka dashboard persewaan
Dashboard -> Database: Query all rentals + stats
Database --> Dashboard: Return data
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan dashboard

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Filter rental (status, date)
Dashboard -> Database: Query with filter
Database --> Dashboard: Return filtered rentals
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan hasil

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik rental untuk detail
Dashboard -> Database: Query rental detail + customer
Database --> Dashboard: Return detail
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan detail

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik "Approve" (pending rental)
Dashboard -> System: Update status = confirmed
System -> Database: Save status change
System -> System: Send notification to customer
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show success

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik "Start Rental"
Dashboard -> System: Verify customer pickup
System -> Dashboard: Ask condition check
Pengurus -> System: Confirm condition awal
System -> Database: Update status = in-use
System -> Database: Record start time
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show confirmation

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik "End Rental"
Dashboard -> System: Record return
Dashboard -> Pengurus: Ask condition + extra fees
Pengurus -> System: Confirm (damage/late)
System -> Database: Update status = returned
System -> Database: Calculate final cost
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show receipt

Pengurus -> Dashboard: View rental reports
Dashboard -> Database: Aggregate rental data
Database --> Dashboard: Return analytics
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show charts & reports

@enduml
